{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16761","headline":"奉使巡检两京路种果树事毕入秦因咏 · 郑审","name":"奉使巡检两京路种果树事毕入秦因咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣德周天壤，韶华满帝畿。\n九重承涣汗，千里树芳菲。\n陕塞余阴薄，关河旧色微。\n发生和气动，封植衆心归。\n春露条应弱，秋霜果定肥。\n影移行子盖，香扑使臣衣。\n入迳迷驰道，分行接禁闱。\n何当扈仙跸，攀折奉恩辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑审","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}